                    <ns14:documentation>Document Generation Service is a service that generate word document based on word template.
 The service can be work through different application with different configuration per each application like template path returned response ..etc .
 Service will fill document with data from request and data configured at Database. 
  The Word Document template that will be used should be in docx format .The variable pattern that defined at template is \$\{variable name\}</ns14:documentation>
                    
                    
